{
  "content": "<h1 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"StartingBalances IntangibleAssets\">Starting Balances — Intangible Assets</h1>\n<p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"IntangibleAssets NewStartingBalance\">This screen allows you to set up your starting balances for the intangible assets that you have created under the <code>Intangible Assets</code> tab. To create a new starting balance for an intangible asset, click the <code>New Starting Balance</code> button.</p>\n<p translate=\"true\"><div><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:shadow-none flex space-x-4 rtl:space-x-reverse shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 dark:text-gray-400 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IntangibleAssets\">IntangibleAssets</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewStartingBalance\">NewStartingBalance</span></span></div></div></div></p>\n<p translate=\"true\">You will be taken to the <code>Starting Balance</code> screen for the intangible asset. See <a href=\"guides/starting-balance-for-intangible-asset-form\">Starting Balance for Intangible Asset Form</a> for more information.</p>\n",
  "key": "starting-balance-for-intangible-asset-list"
}
